---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import BreadcrumbJsonLd from '../components/BreadcrumbJsonLd.astro';
import GoogleReviewCta from '../components/GoogleReviewCta.astro';
import GoogleRating from '../components/GoogleRating.astro';
import { GBP } from '../data/google-profile';
import brandFaqSchema from '../data/brand-faq.json';
const brandFaqJson = JSON.stringify(brandFaqSchema);
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Insurance Support: IRDAI-Registered Advisor in Bengaluru"
  description="Learn about Hari Kotian (IRDAI registration number 0149161D) and Insurance Support, a Bengaluru-based insurance guidance and claim assistance service."
  canonical="https://insurancesupport.online/about/"
  dateModified="2026-11-12"
  pageType="contact"
  keywords="about Hari Kotian insurance advisor, IRDAI advisor 0149161D, Insurance Support Bengaluru, insurance guidance claim assistance, insurance advisor about"
>
  <BreadcrumbJsonLd items={[{ label: 'Home', url: 'https://insurancesupport.online/' }, { label: 'About Hari Kotian', url: 'https://insurancesupport.online/about/' }]} />
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={brandFaqJson} />
  <main id="main" class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-16">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">About Hari Kotian</h1>
    <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 mb-8 leading-relaxed">Hari Kotian (IRDAI registration number <strong>0149161D</strong>) leads Insurance Support, a Bengaluru-based service offering insurance guidance and claim assistance.</p>

    <section class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-7 mb-8" aria-labelledby="about-insurance-support">
      <h2 id="about-insurance-support" class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">What does Insurance Support do?</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">Insurance Support helps people understand policy terms, organize claim documents, review insurer correspondence, and navigate follow-up. The insurer decides each claim under the issued policy and the evidence provided. Complaint forums have separate eligibility requirements and time limits.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-10" aria-labelledby="services-provided">
      <h2 id="services-provided" class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">Insurance guidance and claim assistance</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-slate-700">
        <li>Life, term, health, and motor policy guidance.</li>
        <li>Help organizing documents for an insurance claim.</li>
        <li>Review of an insurer’s written claim decision and related policy terms.</li>
        <li>Guidance on insurer grievance and external complaint information.</li>
        <li>Policy review and servicing questions.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-10" aria-labelledby="brand-assets">
      <h2 id="brand-assets" class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">Brand and reference pages</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-700 leading-relaxed mb-3">Reference pages used by clients, partners, and directories when they describe the practice.</p>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-slate-700">
        <li><a class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800 underline" href="/brand/hari-kotian-insurance-advisor/">Hari Kotian — insurance advisor</a></li>
        <li><a class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800 underline" href="/brand/insurance-support-bangalore/">Insurance Support Bangalore</a></li>
        <li><a class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800 underline" href="/brand/insurance-support-claim-recovery/">Insurance Support claim recovery</a></li>
        <li><a class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800 underline" href="/brand/insurance-support-lic-expert/">Insurance Support LIC expert</a></li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-10" id="editorial-standards" aria-labelledby="editorial-title">
      <h2 id="editorial-title" class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">How these pages are written</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
        This site competes with pages that invent their numbers. The rules below are what keep it from doing the same, and they are the reason a figure is sometimes missing where a competitor would have supplied one.
      </p>
      <ul class="space-y-3 text-slate-700">
        <li><strong class="text-slate-900">Rules are cited, not summarised from memory.</strong> Where a deadline, limit or right is stated, the article names the instrument behind it — the Insurance Ombudsman Rules, 2017, IRDAI’s master circular of 5 September 2024, Section 45 of the Insurance Act — and links the regulator so it can be checked.</li>
        <li><strong class="text-slate-900">No unsourced statistics.</strong> No win rates, no recovery totals, no "families served". If a number cannot be pointed at a public source or a client’s own file, it does not appear.</li>
        <li><strong class="text-slate-900">Reviews are quoted, never invented.</strong> The reviews shown on this site are the ones on the Google Business Profile, quoted verbatim with a link to the profile. None are written here, and none are paid for.</li>
        <li><strong class="text-slate-900">No promised outcomes.</strong> What a page can tell you is the route, the deadline and the argument. It cannot tell you what an insurer or an Ombudsman will decide, and it does not pretend to.</li>
        <li><strong class="text-slate-900">Dates are real.</strong> Pages carry the date they were last reviewed. When a rule changes, the page is rewritten and re-dated — not simply re-published with a new year in the title.</li>
        <li><strong class="text-slate-900">Corrections are welcome.</strong> If something here is out of date or wrong, write to <a class="text-blue-700 underline" href="mailto:hari@insurancesupport.online">hari@insurancesupport.online</a> and it gets fixed or removed.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 p-7 mb-10" aria-labelledby="business-details">
      <h2 id="business-details" class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">Business details</h2>
      <dl class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-slate-700">
        <div><dt class="font-semibold">Business</dt><dd>Insurance Support</dd></div>
        <div><dt class="font-semibold">Lead advisor</dt><dd>Hari Kotian</dd></div>
        <div><dt class="font-semibold">IRDAI registration number</dt><dd>0149161D</dd></div>
        <div><dt class="font-semibold">Location</dt><dd>Bahubali Nagar, Jalahalli, Bengaluru, Karnataka 560013, India</dd></div>
        <div><dt class="font-semibold">Phone</dt><dd><a class="text-blue-700 underline" href="tel:+919986634506">+91 99866 34506</a></dd></div>
        <div><dt class="font-semibold">Office hours</dt><dd>Monday to Saturday, 9:30 am – 6:00 pm IST. Sunday closed.</dd></div>
        <div>
          <dt class="font-semibold">Google listing</dt>
          <dd>
            <a class="text-blue-700 underline" href={GBP.mapsUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{GBP.name}</a>
            <span class="block text-sm text-slate-500">Rated {GBP.rating} of 5 from {GBP.reviewCount} reviews, read on Google on 12 November 2026.</span>
          </dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
    </section>

    <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mb-8">Insurance information is general guidance. Check your issued policy and current insurer or regulator instructions for your situation. Claim outcomes are determined by the insurer under the policy terms.</p>

    <div class="text-center">
      <a href="/contact" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-8 py-4 bg-blue-600 text-white font-bold rounded-full text-lg hover:bg-blue-700 transition-colors shadow-lg">Contact Insurance Support</a>
    </div>

    <div class="mb-10 flex justify-center">
      <GoogleRating variant="card" />
    </div>

    <GoogleReviewCta
      heading="Have we worked together before?"
      body="A Google review takes two minutes and is the only client proof on this site that we do not write ourselves. Reviews are published by Google under your own account, and you can edit or delete yours at any time."
    />
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
